      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$(z-2)(z+4)(z+2)(z-2)(z+4)(z+2)$$ ⓑ $$9z+18(z-2)(z+4)(z+2)9z+18(z-2)(z+4)(z+2)$$ , $$4z2+16z(z-2)(z+4)(z+2)4z2+16z(z-2)(z+4)(z+2)$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
