    <paragraph>Add and Subtract Rational Functions</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, find ⓐ $$R(x) = f(x) + g(x)$$ ⓑ $$R(x) = f(x) - g(x).$$</paragraph>
    <exercise number="143" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$f(x) = \frac{-5x - 5}{x^{2} + x - 6}$$ and $$g(x) = \frac{x + 1}{2 - x}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$R(x)=-(x+8)(x+1)(x-2)(x+3)R(x)=-(x+8)(x+1)(x-2)(x+3)$$ ⓑ $$R(x)=x+1x+3R(x)=x+1x+3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="144" has_solution="false">
