        <paragraph>$$f(x) = \frac{6x}{x^{2} - 64}$$ and $$g(x) = \frac{3}{x - 8}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$3(3x+8)(x-8)(x+8)3(3x+8)(x-8)(x+8)$$ ⓑ $$R(x)=3x+8R(x)=3x+8$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
